 end="2:39.780">く</span><span begin="2:39.780" end="2:39.974">あ</span><span begin="2:39.974" end="2:40.197">ど</span><span begin="2:40.197" end="2:40.416">け</span><span begin="2:40.416" end="2:40.416">な</span><span begin="2:40.416" end="2:40.948">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天真无邪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">terai naku adokenaku</span></p><p begin="2:41.190" end="2:44.526" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.190" end="2:41.332">そ</span><span begin="2:41.332" end="2:41.477">れ</span><span begin="2:41.477" end="2:41.892">で</span><span begin="2:41.892" end="2:42.212">今</span><span begin="2:42.212" end="2:42.449">も</span><span begin="2:42.449" end="2:43.049">惨</span><span begin="2:43.049" end="2:43.345">め</span><span begin="2:43.345" end="2:43.651">に</span><span begin="2:43.651" end="2:43.821">潰</span><span begin="2:43.821" end="2:43.996">さ</span><span begin="2:43.996" end="2:44.217">れ</span><span begin="2:44.217" end="2:44.526">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以现在也惨遭毁灭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore de ima mo mijime ni tsubusareta</span></p><p begin="2:44.753" end="2:47.403" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.753" end="2:45.208">私</span><span begin="2:45.208" end="2:45.533">を</span><span begin="2:45.533" end="2:45.981">掬</span><span begin="2:45.981" end="2:46.340">い</span><span begin="2:46.340" end="2:46.715">上</span><span begin="2:46.715" end="2:47.127">げ</span><span begin="2:47.127" end="2:47.403">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">助我上神坛吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashi o sukui ageru</span></p><p begin="2:47.748" end="2:51.734" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.748" end="2:47.853">取</span><span begin="2:47.853" end="2:47.853">る</span><span begin="2:47.853" end="2:48.697">に</span><span begin="2:48.697" end="2:48.856">足</span><span begin="2:48.856" end="2:48.941">ら</span><span begin="2:48.941" end="2:48.941">な</span><span begin="2:48.941" end="2:49.269">い</span><span begin="2:49.269" end="2:49.458">と</span><span begin="2:49.458" end="2:49.678">施</span><span begin="2:49.678" end="2:49.878">し</span><span begin="2:49.878" end="2:50.102">を</span><span begin="2:50.102" end="2:50.291">く</span><span begin="2:50.291" end="2:50.603">れ</span><span begin="2:50.603" end="2:50.857">ま</span><span begin="2:50.857" end="2:51.423">し</span><span begin="2:51.423" end="2:51.734">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们给了我一个无足轻重的施舍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toru ni taranai to hodokoshi o kuremashita</span></p><p begin="2:52.016" end="2:54.372" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.016" end="2:52.016">そ</span><span begin="2:52.016" end="2:52.302">の</span><span begin="2:52.302" end="2:52.744">鈍</span><span begin="2:52.744" end="2:52.899">さ</span> <span begin="2:52.899" end="2:53.138">嫌</span><span begin="2:53.138" end="2:53.138">い</span><span begin="2:53.138" end="2:53.542">で</span><span begin="2:53.542" end="2:53.721">し</span><span begin="2:53.721" end="2:54.372">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我讨厌啊 那种迟钝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono nibusa kirai deshita</span></p><p begin="2:54.421" end="2:58.152" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.421" end="2:54.561">消</span><span begin="2:54.561" end="2:54.781">え</span><span begin="2:54.781" end="2:55.124">れ</span><span begin="2:55.124" end="2:55.285">ば</span><span begin="2:55.285" end="2:55.285">い</span><span begin="2:55.285" end="2:55.595">い</span><span begin="2:55.595" end="2:55.764">ね</span> <span begin="2:55.764" end="2:56.100">じ</span><span begin="2:56.100" end="2:56.253">ゃ</span><span begin="2:56.253" end="2:56.884">あ</span><span begin="2:56.884" end="2:57.313">ね</span><span begin="2:57.313" end="2:57.491">さ</span><span begin="2:57.491" end="2:57.691">よ</span><span begin="2:57.691" end="2:57.910">な</span><span begin="2:57.910" end="2:58.152">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失就好了 再见吧！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kiereba ii ne jaa ne sayonara</span></p><p begin="2:58.432" end="3:00.700" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.432" end="2:58.718">光</span><span begin="2:58.718" end="2:58.867">の</span><span begin="2:58.867" end="2:59.569">中</span><span begin="2:59.569" end="2:59.850">で</span><span begin="2:59.850" end="3:00.700">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在光芒中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hikari no naka de wa</span></p><p begin="3:01.438" end="3:04.577" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.438" end="3:01.886">も</span><span begin="3:01.886" end="3:02.079">う</span><span begin="3:02.079" end="3:02.352">息</span><span begin="3:02.352" end="3:02.812">が</span> <span begin="3:02.812" end="3:02.970">息</span><span begin="3:02.970" end="3:03.191">が</span><span begin="3:03.191" end="3:03.633">で</span><span begin="3:03.633" end="3:03.794">き</span><span begin="3:03.794" end="3:04.024">な</span><span begin="3:04.024" end="3:04.248">く</span><span begin="3:04.248" end="3:04.577">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经不能呼吸了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mou iki ga iki ga dekinakute</span></p><p begin="3:04.896" end="3:07.315" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.896" end="3:05.090">暗</span><span begin="3:05.090" end="3:05.261">が</span><span begin="3:05.261" end="3:05.447">り</span><span begin="3:05.447" end="3:05.669">の</span><span begin="3:05.669" end="3:06.217">場</span><span begin="3:06.217" end="3:06.408">所</span><span begin="3:06.408" end="3:07.315">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">四周如此黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kuragari no basho o</span></p><p begin="3:07.776" end="3:11.631" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.776" end="3:08.013">誰</span><span begin="3:08.013" end="3:08.242">も</span><span begin="3:08.242" end="3:08.645">教</span><span begin="3:08.645" end="3:09.014">え</span><span begin="3:09.014" end="3:09.382">て</span><span begin="3:09.382" end="3:09.817">く</span><span begin="3:09.817" end="3:10.189">れ</span><span begin="3:10.189" end="3:10.720">な</span><span begin="3:10.720" end="3:10.997">い</span><span begin="3:10.997" end="3:11.199">か</span><span begin="3:11.199" end="3:11.631">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为没有人告诉我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare mo oshiete kurenai kara</span></p><p begin="3:11.534" end="3:14.890" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.534" end="3:11.946">憎</span><span begin="3:11.946" end="3:11.946">し</span><span begin="3:11.946" end="3:12.237">み</span><span begin="3:12.237" end="3:12.559">の</span><span begin="3:12.559" end="3:12.889">果</span><span begin="3:12.889" end="3:13.051">て</span><span begin="3:13.051" end="3:13.336">の</span><span begin="3:13.336" end="3:13.705">果</span><span begin="3:13.705" end="3:13.851">て</span><span begin="3:13.851" end="3:13.851">の</span><span begin="3:13.851" end="3:14.429">果</span><span begin="3:14.429" end="3:14.590">て</span><span begin="3:14.590" end="3:14.890">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">憎恨着直到尽头的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nikushimi no hate no hate no hate mo</span></p><p begin="3:15.491" end="3:18.300" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.491" end="3:15.622">報</span><span begin="3:15.622" end="3:15.786">わ</span><span begin="3:15.786" end="3:15.954">れ</span><span begin="3:15.954" end="3:16.109">る</span><span begin="3:16.109" end="3:16.347">事</span><span begin="3:16.347" end="3:16.529">さ</span><span begin="3:16.529" end="3:16.782">え</span><span begin="3:16.782" end="3:16.979">な</span><span begin="3:16.979" end="3:17.161">い</span><span begin="3:17.161" end="3:17.370">と</span><span begin="3:17.370" end="3:17.525">し</span><span begin="3:17.525" end="3:17.726">て</span><span begin="3:17.726" end="3:18.300">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然连回报都没有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mukuwareru koto sae nai to s